VALUES (691, 'tt0076752', NULL, 'The Spy Who Loved Me', 'The Spy Who Loved Me', 'movie', 1977, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZxHKFxMYvAko680DsRgAZKWcLi.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lhPq8R8qgoyLNWvVTiqZSkYGLPX.jpg', 'Russian and British submarines with nuclear missiles on board both vanish from sight without a trace. England and Russia both blame each other as James Bond tries to solve the riddle of the disappearing ships. But the KGB also has an agent on the case.', NULL, NULL, 10.7036, 6.8, 0, 9.52, '2026-10-27 20:58:06', '2026-10-27 20:58:06')
